t hyena is  named Bruce and she's so proud of that  name that she wears it on a chain around  her neck he's named after billionaire  playboy Bruce Wayne named him Bruce  after Thank You Wayne guy so does Harley  know that Bruce Wayne is Batman  then there's the post-credits audio  snippet and which hardly promises to  tell us a secret she gets as far as  saying it Batman before the audio cuts  given her hyenas name could one assume  hardly is sweet on the Batman we may  never know but it's fun to think about  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the DC movie universe are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bells so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

